      "text": "Explaining a bit more... Windows has a built-in \"Network Service\" account, which is used to handle network traffic.\n\nIt has this so that you can give network traffic its own set of permissions.  Don't want an app to be callable from a network?  Lock down the permissions.\n\nI want _that_ for AI."
